                "text": "The idea of children being hungry, in the wealthiest nation on the planet is unconscionable. \n \nAs I work with my colleagues to write the 2023 Farm Bill, know that I'm laser-focused on making sure we fulfill our promise to protect vital nutrition benefits for our kids & families.",
