                "text": "At today's @SenateAgDems hearing, I made it plain: nobody should have to worry about being able to provide food for their family. \n\nWatch me discuss why the Senate needs to defend access to vital nutrition programs, especially for our children.\nhttps://t.co/pF1otEUxia",
