                "retweet_count": 36,
                "source": "TweetDeck",
                "text": "As a preacher, I believe in the power of redemption. And as a public servant, I believe in getting good done. \n \nThat is why I\u2019m proud to join @SenBooker to push legislation to provide vital nutrition  benefits to returning citizens who have paid their debts to society.",
