                "retweet_count": 56,
                "source": "TweetDeck",
                "text": "If Washington Republicans have their way, we can either deal with the aftermath of defaulting on our debt for the 1st time ever, OR we can allow ~23,000 older Georgia adults to potentially lose vital nutrition benefits. \n\nThat\u2019s a false choice for hardworking Georgia families.",
