                "text": "I\u2019ve been arrested for protesting cuts to vital nutrition programs in the Farm Bill because no kid should go hungry\u2014and certainly not in the richest country in the world.\n\nNow I\u2019m keeping up the fight to protect these programs, as a Senator and member of @SenateAgDems.",
