                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In the wealthiest country in the world, no one should ever go hungry.\n\nSo as we work on the Farm Bill and to keep the government open, I\u2019m pushing to protect vital nutrition benefits to ensure that no Georgian has to worry about how they\u2019ll get their next meal.",
